<title>UK: Severn Trent, sector, up on Ofwat statement.</title>
<headline>Severn Trent, sector, up on Ofwat statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares Severn Trent Water Plc in led a sectorwide rebound in early trading on Thursday, after a statement from British water industry regulator Ofwat contained no negative surprises, analysts said.</p>
<p>At 0738 GMT, Severn Trent shares were up 12p to 730-1/2.</p>
<p>Elsewhere, shares in Thames Water Plc were 7-1/2p higher at 675, while South West Water Plc added 12p to 696-1/2.</p>
</text>
